        "content": "## Objective\n### API Calls using No-Code and With-Code\nA simple registration process to depict various components of a workflow:\n- Nodes\n- Edges (execution and data flow)\n- Logic (using No-code as well as With-Code)\n- 'HTTP Request' node to make remote API calls\n- 'Web-Hook' node, as a REST API listener (endpoint)\n\n- Publish a workflow to Production\n\n### Data Transformation and Cleaning\n* **Processing API Response** There may be multiple API responses. Either use 'Merge Node' or 'Set/Edit Node' to collect the required fields.\n\n#[Guide](https://docs.n8n.io/workflows/components/sticky-notes/)",
